#. じゃあ、食堂で茶でも飲むか。
#. オススメのパワースポットを教えてやんべ。
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You wanna go grab a bite to eat in the dining hall?\n"
"I'll teach you where all the best power spots are!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンから、
#. オススメのパワースポットを教わった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro taught me about all the best power spots...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …んじゃ、一緒に昼寝でもすっか。
#. 寝たら、気分も晴れるべ。
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, you wanna go take a nap? A little mid-day shuteye\n"
"always makes me feel better."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと一緒に昼寝をした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went and took a nap with Hiro...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ？　俺の話を聞きたいんか？
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? You wanna hang out with me?"
msgstr ""

#. よっしゃ！　じゃあ話してやる！
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well then, have I got a story for you!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺が研究の末に突き止めた、
#. レムリア文明と東京タワーの驚くべき関係についてな！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"My research revealed a surprising connection between\n"
"Tokyo Tower and the lost Lemurian civilization!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンのよくわからない話を
#. 延々と聞かせられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro spent a lot of time talking about stuff that\n"
"didn't make any sense to me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、男２人で熱く語り合うべ。
#. 宇宙発生論についてな。
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well then, why don't we have a heated discussion about\n"
"cosmogony!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>宇宙発生論について、
#. 葉隠クンの一方的な見解を述べられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I learned all about Hiro's theories on the origin of\n"
"the universe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hiro a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
